              <p><u>Access controls</u></p>
              <ul>
               <li>Identity=20
                <ul>
                 <li>Controls the authenticity of the user's identity</li>
                </ul></li>
               <li>API=20
                <ul>
                 <li>Controls the access to the API endpoints</li>
                </ul></li>
               <li>Application=20
                <ul>
                 <li>Controls the access to the application itself</li>
                </ul></li>
               <li>Feature/Resource=20
                <ul>
                 <li>Controls the access to the features &amp; resources wi=
thin the said application</li>
                </ul></li>
               <li>Data=20
                <ul>
                 <li>Controls the access to data, stored<span>&nbsp;</span>=
<u>in the confines</u><span>&nbsp;</span>of the application OR<span>&nbsp;<=
/span><u>outside</u>, i.e. in NBC's various data stores</li>
                </ul></li>
              </ul>
